WEBVTT

00:05:29.116 --> 00:05:32.453
She's gasping for air,
and John takes her to the hospital.

00:05:32.495 --> 00:05:34.955
And a nurse at the hospital
asked Stephanie,

00:05:34.997 --> 00:05:38.709
"Mrs. Rinka, would you like us
to put you on a ventilator?"

00:05:40.503 --> 00:05:42.880
And Stephanie says yes.

00:05:44.423 --> 00:05:45.800
John is flabbergasted.

00:05:45.841 --> 00:05:48.260
They've been having
this conversation for 30 years.

00:05:48.302 --> 00:05:50.262
Surely that's not what Stephanie wants.

00:05:50.262 --> 00:05:51.639
He doesn't say anything.

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:53.766
The next morning, he says,

00:05:53.766 --> 00:05:57.520
"Steph, when the nurse asked you yesterday
if you wanted to go on a ventilator,

00:05:57.561 --> 00:05:58.938
and you said yes,

00:05:58.979 --> 00:06:00.481
is that really what you want?"